---
import BaseEn from '../../layouts/BaseEn.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
---
<BaseEn title="OneTech Solutions — Automation & AI Systems" description="OneTech Solutions builds AI-supported automation that works in Arabic and English: customer intake on your channels, order and stock alerts, and an assistant that answers from your own documents.">

	<section class="hero6">
		<div class="wrap hero6-grid">
			<div>
				<div class="eyebrow">Automation & AI — in Arabic and English</div>
				<h1>Smart operations systems that answer your customers, organize your orders, <span class="grad">and give your team its time back.</span></h1>
				<p class="lead">
					OneTech Solutions builds AI-supported automation that works in Arabic and English, starting with three launch
					services: customer intake on your channels, order and stock alerts, and an assistant that answers your
					customers' recurring questions from your own documents.
				</p>
				<div class="hero-ctas">
					<a class="cta" href="https://wa.me/963995263075">Book a free discovery session</a>
					<a class="cta-ghost" href="#offers">Explore services</a>
				</div>
				<div class="trust-row">
					<span>No commitment before the payoff is clear</span>
					<span>Written quote with price and timeline</span>
					<span>Results measured before and after</span>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="panel" role="img" aria-label="How the system works: a customer message enters the system and comes out as an automatic reply, a stock alert, or a daily report">
				<span class="float-chip a" aria-hidden="true">Works in Arabic</span>
				<span class="float-chip b" aria-hidden="true">Measured by numbers</span>
				<div class="panel-head" aria-hidden="true">
					<span class="panel-title">How the system works</span>
					<span class="panel-live">Workflow illustration</span>
				</div>
				<div class="msg" aria-hidden="true">
					<span class="p-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 11.5a8.4 8.4 0 01-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 01-7.6 4.7 8.4 8.4 0 01-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.4 8.4 0 01-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 014.7-7.6 8.4 8.4 0 013.8-.9h.5a8.5 8.5 0 018 8v.5z"/></svg></span>
					<div>Your customer messages you on their channel<small>WhatsApp or the channel you rely on</small></div>
				</div>
				<div class="flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="16" height="20" viewBox="0 0 16 20" fill="none"><path d="M8 1v14m0 0l-5-5m5 5l5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
				<div class="core" aria-hidden="true">
					<span class="p-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 2L4 14h6l-1 8 9-12h-6l1-8z"/></svg></span>
					<div>The OneTech system receives and processes<small>Sorts the request and matches it against your files and policies</small></div>
				</div>
				<div class="flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="16" height="20" viewBox="0 0 16 20" fill="none"><path d="M8 1v14m0 0l-5-5m5 5l5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
				<div class="flow-outcomes" aria-hidden="true">
					<span>Automatic reply</span>
					<span>Low-stock alert</span>
					<span>Daily summary report</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<div class="strip rv">
		<div class="wrap">
			<div class="strip-label">Technologies we build with</div>
			<div class="strip-row">
				<span>n8n</span>
				<span>Telegram Bot API</span>
				<span>Supabase / PostgreSQL</span>
				<span>Google Workspace</span>
				<span>Cloud AI models</span>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<section id="offers">
		<div class="wrap">
			<div class="eyebrow rv">Launch services</div>
			<h2 class="rv">Three services in our launch plan</h2>
			<p class="section-sub rv">We start with what clearly solves one daily problem, and measure the result before any expansion.</p>
			<div class="bento rv-stagger">
				<div class="card b-main">
					<Icon name="chat" />
					<h3>Customer intake on your channels</h3>
					<p>Channel, customer record, automatic reply, follow-up, daily report — fewer lost messages and fewer customers left waiting.</p>
					<div class="mini-flow" aria-hidden="true">
						<span>Channel</span>
						<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg>
						<span>Customer record</span>
						<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg>
						<span>Auto reply</span>
						<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg>
						<span>Follow-up & report</span>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="card b-half">
					<Icon name="bell" />
					<h3>Order and stock alerts</h3>
					<p>A notification for every new order, and an alert when an item runs low before you discover it the hard way.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="card b-half">
					<Icon name="spark" />
					<h3>AI assistant on your documents</h3>
					<p>Answers your customers' recurring questions from your own price lists and policies — in Arabic or English.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="card b-wide roadmap">
					<div class="grow">
						<span class="tag">Roadmap</span>
						<h3>Advanced levels</h3>
						<p>Advanced document processing, sector templates, AI agents, and local/offline deployment — announced only when actually ready.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="roadmap-note rv">
				Your first step is a fixed-scope pilot project starting at <b>$800</b> for international clients, with a written
				quote covering price and timeline before any commitment.
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="automation-demo" class="soft"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Automation demos</div><div class="demo-grid"><div><h2>Try an order and stock-alert flow</h2><p class="section-sub">An interactive Telegram demo showing a store order and stock-alert flow with buttons and fictional data.</p><div class="hero-ctas"><a class="cta" href="https://t.me/OneTechMENADemoBot">Try the Telegram demo ↗</a><a class="cta-ghost" href="/discovery">Discuss your workflow</a></div></div><div class="card demo-note"><span class="tag">Illustration only</span><p>This is not an AI system or a real client project. It does not create orders, change inventory or send notifications outside the chat.</p><p><b>Do not send private information.</b> The demo opens in Telegram and runs in Arabic.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section id="method" class="soft">
		<div class="wrap">
			<div class="eyebrow rv">Our method</div>
			<h2 class="rv">How we work</h2>
			<p class="section-sub rv">Four clear steps, no commitment before you know the payoff.</p>
			<ol class="timeline rv">
				<li><b>Free discovery session</b><span>Thirty minutes to understand your daily process and measure its current time and cost.</span></li>
				<li><b>An honest recommendation</b><span>We tell you plainly whether automation fits your case, and calculate the expected return before you pay.</span></li>
				<li><b>A clear offer</b><span>Defined scope, defined timeline, a short first pilot — no surprises.</span></li>
				<li><b>Before-and-after measurement</b><span>Real numbers from your operation: response time, errors, hours saved.</span></li>
			</ol>
			<div class="roadmap-note rv">
				<b>Designed for failure:</b> every automation we build ships with an instant failure alert and a manual fallback
				plan, because internet, power and channels can go down. If something breaks, you know right away and your team keeps working by hand until it is fixed.
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="intl">
		<div class="wrap">
			<div class="eyebrow rv">For agencies and startups</div>
			<h2 class="rv">Working with international clients</h2>
			<p class="section-sub rv">
				We propose custom automation for agencies and startups, starting with a clearly scoped pilot. Scope, delivery, price and terms are agreed in writing before work begins.
			</p>
			<div class="measure rv-stagger">
				<div class="m">
					<h3>Response time to customers</h3>
					<p>How many minutes does a customer wait for your reply today? That is the first number we measure and improve.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="m">
					<h3>Order and invoice errors</h3>
					<p>Lost orders and manual invoice entry become an automated record whose errors you can review.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="m">
					<h3>Hours saved every month</h3>
					<p>A monthly report shows your team's saved time and the number of automated operations, so you know what your money bought.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="cta-band" id="contact">
		<div class="wrap">
			<div class="eyebrow light">Next step</div>
			<h2>Start with a free discovery session</h2>
			<p>Thirty minutes to understand your process, with an honest answer on whether automation fits — no commitment. Service details and terms are finalized in a written contract.</p>
			<div class="cta-row">
				<a class="cta" href="https://wa.me/963995263075">Message us on WhatsApp</a>
				<a class="cta-alt" href="mailto:onetechmena@proton.me"><span dir="ltr">onetechmena@proton.me</span></a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

<style>.demo-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;gap:32px;align-items:center}.demo-grid .hero-ctas{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}.demo-grid .cta-ghost{color:#24468b;border-color:#8ca5d1}.demo-note p{line-height:1.9;margin:14px 0 0}.demo-note{padding:28px}@media(max-width:700px){.demo-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}.demo-grid h2{font-size:30px}.demo-note{padding:22px}}</style>
</BaseEn>
